  pdf={https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v306/main/assets/abdollahpoorrostam26a/abdollahpoorrostam26a.pdf},
  abstract={We introduce MonoSoup, a hyperparameter-free, data-free post-hoc method that recovers Model-Soup-level out-of-distribution accuracy from a single fine-tuned checkpoint. By applying SVD to per-layer weight updates and re-weighting high-/low-energy directions, MonoSoup reduces ensembling cost from O(K) to O(1) while preserving the generalization benefits of weight-space averaging.},
